<title>UK: Goldman Sachs set calls on a European banks basket.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs set calls on a European banks basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on a European Bank restructuring basket.</p>
<p>The equally weighted basket includes shares of Bayerische</p>
<p>Hypobank, Deutsche Bank, Nordbanken AB, </p>
<p>Bank of Scotland, Credito Italiano, </p>
<p>Credit Commercial de France, Merita Ltd, </p>
<p>Banco Popular Espanol, Argentaria</p>
<p>National Westminster Bank and Unidanmark.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1000 DEM		  PREMIUM	11.53 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.153 DEM		 GEARING	8.67 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 13.AUG.97-29.OCT.98   PAYDATE	12.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   DUSS, FFURT, STUTT    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1000 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
